1
00:00:00,003 --> 00:00:03,343
(Sheldon:)...Miscellaneous Duties,
you are obligated to take me to the dentist.

2
00:00:03,507 --> 00:00:09,267
See? Here, after "providing a confirmation
sniff on questionable dairy products."

3
00:00:10,222 --> 00:00:13,142
You know what?
I am sick of the Roommate Agreement.

4
00:00:16,103 --> 00:00:18,853
(Leonard:)It's ridiculous, I'm your roommate,
not your chauffeur.

5
00:00:19,022 --> 00:00:20,982
(Leonard:)I had better things to do yesterday...

6
00:00:21,149 --> 00:00:24,529
...than drive you to the good
model train store in Garden Grove...

7
00:00:24,695 --> 00:00:28,655
(Leonard:)...because the one in Pasadena
has gotten too big for its britches.

8
00:00:29,199 --> 00:00:32,159
(Sheldon:)Well, it has. Ask anybody.

9
00:00:32,327 --> 00:00:34,417
(Leonard:)I don't care. I'm done.

10
00:00:34,579 --> 00:00:39,079
(Sheldon:)Hold on. Are you saying that
you want to invoke Clause 209?

11
00:00:39,251 --> 00:00:43,091
(Leonard:)I don't know what that is, but if it means
I can go home and sleep, then yes.

12
00:00:43,255 --> 00:00:46,505
(Sheldon:)Think carefully here.
Clause 209 suspends our friendship...

13
00:00:46,675 --> 00:00:49,345
...and strips the Roommate Agreement
to its essentials.

14
00:00:49,511 --> 00:00:52,141
(Sheldon:)Our responsibilities toward
each other would be rent...

15
00:00:52,306 --> 00:00:56,056
(Sheldon:)...utilities and a perfunctory chin jut
of recognition as we pass in the hall.

16
00:00:56,226 --> 00:01:01,026
What's up?

